  <div id="sutta">
  
                <h3 id="AN5.198" class="h1">A Statement<br/>
                  Vācā Sutta  (AN 5:198)</h3><!--end suttahead-->
                <p>“Monks, a statement endowed with five factors is well-spoken, not ill-spoken. It is blameless &amp; unfaulted by knowledgeable people. Which five?</p>
                <p>“It is spoken at the right time. It is spoken in truth. It is spoken affectionately. It is spoken beneficially. It is spoken with a mind of goodwill.</p>
                <p>“A statement endowed with these five factors is well-spoken, not ill-spoken. It is blameless &amp; unfaulted by knowledgeable people.”</p>
                <p class="seealso">See also: <a href="../MN/MN21.html">MN 21</a>; <a href="../MN/MN58.html">MN 58</a>; <a href="AN4_183.html">AN 4:183</a>; AN 10:176; <a href="../KN/StNp/StNp3_3.html">Sn 3:3</a></p><!--end seealso-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
